abstract: >-
  Reproducibility archive for breast ultrasound lesion segmentation,
  including the manuscript-facing BCMR-Net entry point, phase-semantic
  contour arbitration (PSCA), and complementary evidence transfer (CET).
  The archive contains code, locked protocols, derived metrics, figure
  source data, and editable diagrams, but no raw clinical data or model
  checkpoints.
keywords:
  - breast ultrasound
  - image segmentation
  - knowledge distillation
  - contour arbitration
  - boundary calibration
  - reproducibility
